== 2026-09-14 note (hc2): "proof-queued-midnight" at 15:01:34Z stayed GREEN, so it measured nothing. Its spec ("a check-in still
   queued across midnight") keeps yesterday's saved list, and the queued check-in shows on that list whether or not the
   queue is consulted. The queue path matters only when no list for that day is saved under the page's key. The proof now
   runs against "a check-in queued before midnight under an old link…": the office makes a new link and the phone opens it
   after midnight, when only the queue knows the visit is open. It is re-run below.

