== 2026-09-14 M3d note (hc2): in the first M3d run of every control and proof (16:10–16:20Z), "proof-earlier-days" and
   "proof-earlier-without-today" were VOID because their unbroken copies failed. The full suite run just before had failed in the
   same test: "a Saturday check-in still open on Monday…" failed at the Check out tap with "Element is not attached to the DOM".
   Since clarification 18 the page draws Saturday from the phone first, then again when Saturday's list answers, and the tap
   landed in that redraw (a spec race). The spec now waits for Saturday's list to answer, and brings the signal back only after
   Check out is tapped. The test passed 12/12 (3 runs on each of the four projects), and the full suite passed alone (16:32Z).
   The entries from that first run were lost when this note was written (an edit of the log file), so every control and proof
   was run again below, alone, with `npm run negative`.

